  "description": "<div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">SNOAP is a revolutionary solid soap and solid shampoo dispenser. &nbsp;<br>The Dispenser holds solid bars and dispenses a fine powder - which is super efficient. &nbsp;Each 110g bar replaces 10 x 250ml bottles of liquid hand, hair or body wash. &nbsp;Saving you money and the environment at the same time!<br>SNOAP has zero single-use plastic. &nbsp;Our bars nourish with every wash as they contain natural moisturises so there is no need to buy the extra moisturisers. &nbsp;SNOAP produces much cleaner waste water than liquid alternatives. &nbsp;Because SNOAP is super efficient, the cost of a 250ml refill equivalent is 55p - SNOAP is kind to YOU, the PLANET and your WALLET!<br>Payments to Affiliates will be made on a monthly basis unless discussed otherwise.<br>SNOAP is a family business, it is about more than reducing plastic poluution - it's a movement a growing movement - SNOAP is about making SOAP GRATE AGAIN - are you in? &nbsp;You can find out more <a href=\"https://snoap.com/pages/how-it-works\" title=\"How it works...\">here.</a></p>\r\n</div>",
